{
  "text": "[confident] Meet Forge. Your vending and inventory systems, finally working together.\n\nThe dashboard brings AutoCrib and CribMaster into one view: customers, stations, stocked items, and pending actions. Red stock-out alerts point straight to the station needing attention. [playfully] No treasure hunt required.\n\nFind customers by name or account code. Results narrow as you type. Each card shows stations, items, machine brand, location, pending recommendations, and stock-outs.\n\nOpen an account for its station count, total items, low stock, and pending actions.\n\nScroll through stations to inspect quantities, min-max settings, pack sizes, warehouse availability, and incoming orders. Select replenishment items, adjust quantities, and create an order summary.\n\nFor live installations, Forge is designed to combine its proprietary inventory calculations with your choice of frontier AI\u2014ChatGPT, Claude, Grok, or local models\u2014to optimize min-max levels using real usage data.\n\nThe Machine Library counts each machine type across your fleet. [confident] Forge. Keep inventory moving\u2014and guesswork parked.",
